          "text": "Mana induukho niyula ahambi yokhufwa khwaIsiraeli; nalanga omwanawe Yusufu, namusunjila ari Shinga olwa enyoolile obukoosia imbeliwo, chama orekhwo omukhonokwo khwirango lianje, ukholele akeshisa nende akatoto; ekhusaaya mbu orayabila muMisiri tawe; ",
